        Set ComProperty of (phDispatchDriver(Self)) 20 OLE_VT_BOOL to value
    End_Procedure

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False }
    Function ComAllowScroll Returns Boolean
        Boolean retVal
        Get ComProperty of (phDispatchDriver(Self)) 21 OLE_VT_BOOL to retVal
        Function_Return retVal
    End_Function

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False }
    Procedure Set ComAllowScroll Boolean value
        Set ComProperty of (phDispatchDriver(Self)) 21 OLE_VT_BOOL to value
    End_Procedure

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False }
    Function ComAxisX Returns Variant
        Handle hDispatchDriver
        Variant retVal
        Get phDispatchDriver to hDispatchDriver
        Get InvokeComMethod of hDispatchDriver 1 OLE_VT_DISPATCH to retVal
        Function_Return retVal
    End_Function

    { MethodType=Property DesignTime=False }
    Function ComAxisY Returns Variant
        Handle hDispatchDriver
        Variant retVal
        Get phDispatchDriver to hDispatchDriver
